-------------------------------------------
BOSS 4.1 Release Note #  2   March 12, 1999
-------------------------------------------

(1) Patch for Normal Mode Calculations
    for versions of BOSS 4.1 prior to March 12
Since '999' is used to flag a comment line in the parameter file,
the following line in SUBROUTINE RDATYPE in boss41.f (UNIX) or
calc41.f (Windows) should be changed from

           IF (LINE(1:3).EQ.'   '.OR.LINE(1:3).EQ.'999') GO TO 80
to
           IF (LINE(1:3).EQ.'   ') GO TO 80
           IF (LINE(1:3).EQ.'999') GO TO 50

Otherwise, non-bonded interactions in the normal mode analysis
are not computed correctly when the parameter file contains
'999' as atom types.
-DC

